# What the machine needs, and the command that fixes anything missing.
# fixtures: off
# The report prints where Claude Code is installed, so this chapter runs
# against the machine's own installation rather than the fixture that answers
# for the agent list.
title lmux doctor
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter Is the machine ready
caption lmux doctor | tmux, git, Claude Code, the sandbox, the terminal
type env -u TMUX -u TMUX_PANE lmux doctor
enter
wait 3
frame 6
